{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "contract_id": "ft.deferred_proof_replay_harness.tamper.v1",
  "description": "Adversarial single-receipt inputs. The dry-run replay classifier MUST reject each one as specified and MUST NEVER emit a green/runnable decision for it. These lock the fail-closed invariants of ft-zbnz4.6: local cargo is never proof, stale shapes never run, and a selected-worker topology-preflight failure is a distinct blocker (not no-worker-admission, not code failure, never green).",
